            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Airborne 0.3.20

- Local map markers stack Wastewater (WW) and ED visits in compact rounded boxes.
- State boxes place a bold state code above a divider, with metrics arranged below in one or two columns.
- Crowded state boxes move apart where space allows and remain in front of local markers and labels.
- Marker sizing and local labels adapt to the taller boxes. Existing state and HHS region zoom tiers remain in place.
]]></description>
